Description: Qt log viewer for mc_rtc logs and CSV files
 mc_log_ui is a PyQt-based desktop application for browsing, comparing and
 exporting mc_rtc log files, and can also inspect compatible CSV logs.
 .
 The package installs the Python module together with the mc_log_ui and
 plot_logs entry points and the desktop launcher.
